maybePause: samples = roundSuccess + roundFailed; if status==ACTIVE && samples >= sampleFloor && roundFailed*100 >= samples*threshold → pauseIfActive + insert pause record with counts. Since row lock held, pauseIfActive will affect 1 row. Use the counts from `updated` (read after increment, same tx). Insert pause record with triggerTaskId = taskId, pausedAtUtc = Instant.now(clock).toString().

